HTTP request
GET /teams/{team-id}/channels
Optional query parameters
This method supports the $filter and $select OData query parameters to help customize the response.
Populating the email property for a channel is an expensive operation that results in slow performance. Use $select
to exclude the email property to improve performance.
Request body
Don't supply a request body for this method.
Response
If successful, this method returns a 200 OK
response code and collection of Channel objects in the response body.
Examples
Example 1: List all channels
