permissionProfile |
This value specifies the permission you grant to the Azure DevOps pool when you create it. You can set this value only when you create a pool. Allowed values are Inherit , CreatorOnly , and SpecificAccounts . If you specify specificAccounts , provide a single email address or a list of email addresses for the users property. Otherwise, omit users . For more information, see Pool administration permissions. |
kind |
This value specifies the type of organization for the pool, and must be set to Azure DevOps . |
